connected to two O's, each by a double line. There are two pairs of dots next to each O.","target":"https://cdn.kastatic.org/ka-content-images/f3fc67d66b6eccc658636ee84d8950b2b35f25de.svg","line":9,"embedded":true},{"title":"A C connected to four H's, each by a single line.","target":"https://cdn.kastatic.org/ka-content-images/84acf1f96e1242284f96b6871fd15cb04aad5ecc.svg","line":10,"embedded":true},{"title":"A black ball is connected to four white balls, each by one gray stick. The white balls stick out in different directions, forming a 3D tetrahedral shape.","target":"https://cdn.kastatic.org/ka-content-images/d7f507ef384d269ae85837d5c28032464367690b.png","line":10,"embedded":true},{"title":"An N connected to three H's, each by a single line. There is a pair of dots next to the N.","target":"https://cdn.kastatic.org/ka-content-images/1ccf13821dbc87f50f01519c17c378be17f81817.svg","line":11,"embedded":true},{"title":"A blue ball is connected to three white balls, each by one gray stick. The white balls are all slightly below the blue ball in different directions, forming the shape of a shallow mountain.","target":"https://cdn.kastatic.org/ka-content-images/7bd7000f74a71aebd1c9b47e6e1dae511b9c9f7a.png","line":11,"embedded":true},{"title":"Many red and gray balls connected in a net-like pattern. Each connection consists of a single gray stick.","target":"https://cdn.kastatic.org/ka-content-images/23eebebf32ef3490b087dff5b366993588b8c093.png","line":29,"embedded":true}],"class_name":"SmartBlock"},
